      "description": "Run the showcase docs site locally in three steps.",
      "sourcePath": "source/quickstart/index.mdx",
      "body": "---\ntitle: Quickstart\ndescription: Run the showcase docs site locally in three steps.\nkeywords: [\"quickstart\", \"install\", \"dev server\"]\nicon: rocket\n---\n\nFollow these steps to run the site.\n\n<Step>\n  <StepItem title=\"Install dependencies\">\n\n```bash\npnpm install\n```\n\n  </StepItem>\n\n  <StepItem title=\"Start the dev server\">\n\n```bash\npnpm dev\n```\n\n  </StepItem>\n\n  <StepItem title=\"Open the site\">\n    Open `http://localhost:3000` in the browser.\n  </StepItem>\n</Step>\n\n## Choose a deployment target\n\n<Tabs defaultValue=\"cloudflare\" className=\"pt-5 pb-1\">\n  <TabsList>\n    <TabsTrigger value=\"cloudflare\">Cloudflare</TabsTrigger>\n    <TabsTrigger value=\"vercel\">Vercel</TabsTrigger>\n  </TabsList>\n  <TabsContent value=\"cloudflare\">\n\n```bash\npnpm build:cloudflare\n```\n\n  </TabsContent>\n  <TabsContent value=\"vercel\">\n\n```bash\npnpm build:vercel\n```\n\n  </TabsContent>\n</Tabs>\n\n<Note title=\"Success\" type=\"success\">\n  The local docs site is running.\n</Note>\n",
